      "writtenOn": "2023-02-24T01:13:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve pulled out most of the refactoring and mutex work so this change is more focused on the concurrency behavior.\n\nI\u0027ve opted for the second option:\n* TraceDataSource records whether that instance\u0027s Start succeeded and won\u0027t call Stop if it didn\u0027t.\n* Start increments the session count only if tracing is already active or if we get to the end and return true.",
